#title: A-scan from a metal cylinder buried in a dielectric half-space
#domain: 0.500 0.700 0.002
domain: 0.240 0.210 0.002
#dx_dy_dz: 0.003 0.003 0.003
dx_dy_dz: 0.002 0.002 0.002
#time_window: 20e-9
(was 3ns)

#material: 6 0 1 0 half_space

#waveform: ricker 1 1.5e9 my_ricker
#hertzian_dipole: z 0.100 0.190 0 my_ricker
hertzian_dipole: z 0.100 0.170 0 my_ricker
#rx: 0.140 0.190 0
rx: 0.140 0.170 0

#box: 0 0 0 0.500 0.500 0.002 half_space
box: 0 0 0 0.240 0.170 0.002 half_space
#cylinder: 0.120 0.100 0 0.120 0.100 0.002 0.030 pec
cylinder: 0.120 0.050 0 0.120 0.050 0.002 0.010 pec (forgot what original was)


#geometry_view: 0 0 0 0.240 0.210 0.002 0.002 0.002 0.002 cylinder_half_space n


To run paraview go in terminal while in gprMax env, and go to ~/Downloads/Paraview..../bin and then use command ./paraview to open it. open another terminal if want to keep using paraview, or close and reopen after changes have been made



